difficult to hear.  Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to motion"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to signal by using a movement or gesture"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I was motioned to a chair and I was given a wonderful cup of scented tea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to recall the past."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stack"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a number of items piled on top of each other"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Pictures from the exotic places he had visited were placed in a neat stack. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inlaid"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "set into the surface of something with a decorative piece"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  The inlaid wood coffee table that was shipped back from China decades ago."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "recollection"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "memory"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Anyone who was allowed to listen to recollections gladly sat in silence."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "privileged"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having special advantages "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They knew they were being given a glimpse into a world few people of his age were privileged to have seen."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to nod off "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to fall asleep "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Being very advanced in age, George often nodded off."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to slip off"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to fall asleep unintentionally"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: After waking from his nap, he would continue on for a while before slipping off once again."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to the four corners of the earth"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "all parts of the world"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Having a busy life traveling to the four corners of the earth was what he enjoyed for many years."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "illuminating"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "helping to make something clear or easier to understand"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I always looked forward to those illuminating afternoon soliloquies. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "soliloquy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the act of saying one's thought out loud"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I always looked forward to those illuminating afternoon soliloquies. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le08ob09aud10"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le08ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Adverbial Clauses: Reduced Forms"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to express your ideas in a more concise way, you can shorten an adverbial clause to an adverbial phrase."}, {"type": "text", "content": "A clause is a group of words with a subject and a verb.</br>A phrase is a group of words which may include nouns and verbs, but does not have a subject.  </br></br> Before you reduce an adverb clause into an adverbial phrase, make sure that the adverbial clause (subordinate clause) and the main clause have the same subject."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:  </br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">As I had slept for ten hours</span>, I felt marvelous.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Both clauses have the same subject and hence we can reduce the adverb clause into a phrase:  </br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Having slept for ten hours</span>, I felt marvelous.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Generally speaking, the adverbial clauses of time, cause and contrast can be reduced."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Being very advanced in age, George often nodded off."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Having nothing more pressing to do, I would quietly slip into the kitchen. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "His not having a housekeeper in on Wednesdays, made me choose it as our special day.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "After waking from his nap, he would continue on for a while before slipping off once again."}, {"type": "example", "content": "After sitting and listening for the afternoon, I would always make Geoge his favorite meal."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Despite having a great deal of money and life experience, he had few friends."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Now, even though having a busy life traveling to the far corners of the earth was what he enjoyed for many years, having a quiet life now suited him just as well."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Although my being so much younger and still wanting to give up a day off every week may have seemed abnormal to some, I always looked forward to those illuminating afternoon soliloquies. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Passive to Report Events"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past to talk about finished events at a particular time in the past.</br></br>   You often choose the passive form when you want to talk about an action but are not so interested in saying who or what does/did it. Passives without agents (the doers) are common in academic and scientific writing as well as reports. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure of the Simple Past passive is:  </br></br>subject + <span class=\"italic\">was/were</span> + past participle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:</br><span class=\"italic\"> I was motioned to a chair and I was given a wonderful cup of scented tea. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Sometimes you use the preposition <span class=\"italic\">by</span> to mention the person or thing that did the action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: </br><span class=\"italic\">They knew they were given a glimpse into a world few people have seen by someone who had experienced it.   </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Because this is the Simple Past tense, there is often a specific time or date mentioned in the sentence, or at least referred to in the context. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Pictures from the exotic places he had visited were placed in a neat stack."}, {"type": "example", "content": "They were on the inlaid wood coffee table that was shipped back from China decades ago. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Pictures of the famous people he has met were arranged artistically on the pale celery green wall behind him. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Anyone who was allowed to listen to recollections gladly sat in silence. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ask someone older you know to tell you a story from their past or if you don't know anyone older, make one up."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take notes and put the story on a time line."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Add extra notes saying when or why something was done."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice retelling the story aloud from your notes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Retell the story with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I listen to a story told by an older person."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I put my notes on a timeline."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I add reduced adverb phrases."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice retelling the story aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my story with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le08ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le08ob09re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le08ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "George wanted to talk about his travels. He has always been a person who loves to talk about himself. I was motioned to a chair and I was given a wonderful cup of scented tea. Pictures from the exotic places he had visited were placed in a neat stack on the inlaid wood coffee table that was shipped back from China decades ago.</br>Pictures of the famous people he has met were arranged artistically on the pale celery green wall behind him. Anyone who was allowed to listen to recollections gladly sat in silence. They knew they were being given a glimpse into a world few people of his age were privileged to have seen.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le08ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Being very advanced in age, George often nodded off. Having nothing more pressing to do, I would quietly slip into the kitchen to make another pot or tea or add a few biscuits to the plate.  After waking from his nap, he would continue on for a while before slipping off once again.</br>Despite having a great deal of money and life experience, he had few friends. Most had passed on. Now, even though having a busy life traveling to the four corners of the earth was what he enjoyed for many years, having a quiet life now suited him just as well.", "id": 2, "time": "39000", "image": "engenn10le08ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "After sitting and listening for the afternoon, I would always make George his favorite meal. His not having a housekeeper in on Wednesdays, made me choose it as our special day. Although my being so much younger and still wanting to give up a day off every week may have seemed abnormal to some, I always looked forward to those illuminating afternoon soliloquies.", "id": 3, "time": "76000", "image": "engenn10le08ob09re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about history and civilization."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about when or why something is done or contrast two related events or actions. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can report facts about events or actions. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How often do the older people in your family talk about the past?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What things do they talk about?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": " Elderly people often tell great stories!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nThat table was shipped back from China <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">decades</span>ago.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": 